<div class="{{personClass.person}} animate__animated animate__bounceInLeft">
  <div class="{{personClass.personAvatar}}">
  <img  src="/img/avatar.jpeg"></img>
  </div>

  <span class="{{personClass.personNickname}} text-xl">
    {{#if userNickname}}
    {{userNickname}}
    {{else}}
    暖阳
    {{/if}}</span>
  <span class="{{personClass.personMotto}} text-xs">
    {{#if motto}}
    {{motto}}
    {{else}}
    用代码温暖世界，用文字照亮前路
    {{/if}}
  </span>
  <div class="{{personClass.personData}}">
    <div class="{{personClass.personDataArticle}}"><span class="text-xs {{personClass.personDataArticleIcon}}">文章</span><span
        class="{{personClass.personDataArticleNum}} text-base">
        {{#if articlesNum}}
        {{articlesNum}}
        {{else}}
        128k
        {{/if}}
      </span></div>
    <div class="{{personClass.personDataReader}}"><span class="text-xs {{personClass.personDataReaderIcon}}">读者</span><span
        class="{{personClass.personDataReaderNum}} text-base">
        {{#if readerNum}}
        {{readerNum}}
        {{else}}
        5.2k
        {{/if}}</span></div>
  </div>
  <span class="{{personClass.personTag}} text-sm">
    {{#if personalTag}}
    {{personalTag}}
    {{else}}
    前端开发工程师，热爱技术分享与开源贡献。专注于React、TypeScript和现代前端工程化实践前端开发工程师，热爱技术分享与开源贡献。专注于React、TypeScript和现代前端工程化实践前端开发工程师，热爱技术分享与开源贡献。专注于React、TypeScript和现代前端工程化实践前端开发工程师，热爱技术分享与开源贡献。专注于React、TypeScript和现代前端工程化实践前端开发工程师，热爱技术分享与开源贡献。专注于React、TypeScript和现代前端工程化实践前端开发工程师，热爱技术分享与开源贡献。专注于React、TypeScript和现代前端工程化实践
    {{/if}}

  </span>
  <div class="{{personClass.personNav}}">
    <div class="{{personClass.personNavGth}} {{personClass.personNavItem}}"></div>
    <div class="{{personClass.personNavBili}}  {{personClass.personNavItem}} "></div>
    <div class="{{personClass.personNavEmail}}  {{personClass.personNavItem}}"></div>
  </div>
</div>